OL,3,GNEWSAM8 westbound partially reopens
OL,4,Aafter bus bursts into flames near
OL,5,ALivingston
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe M8 westbound has partially reopened
OL,8,Fafter a bus burst into flames during
OL,9,Frush hour.
OL,11,FThe busy motorway was closed between
OL,12,Fjunctions two and three after the fire
OL,13,Fwas reported at about 16:55.
OL,15,FTraffic Scotland said lane one remained
OL,16,Fclosed but traffic was now moving in
OL,17,Flane two.
OL,19,FHowever, it warned that drivers could
OL,20,Fstill expect delays.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
